  "notes": [
    "Object keys sort by Unicode code point. A JavaScript implementation cannot use the default Array.prototype.sort, which orders by UTF-16 code unit and therefore puts astral keys before U+E000..U+FFFF. The keys-astral-versus-bmp case exists to catch exactly that."
  ]
